 "notes": [
  "Posted 11 August 2001 with no Coruscant-set cards, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards are marked '(st)' in the list: Tatooine: Desert Landing Site, Tatooine: Jabba's Palace and Combat Readiness (no objective); they count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Jabba's Palace Audience Chamber' dested the Dark Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber (Dark); 'Combat Readiness (st)' dested the printed Combat Readiness (the starting interrupt).",
  "Posted 'Darth Maul' dested Darth Maul (Tatooine); 'Darth Vader' dested Darth Vader (Premiere); 'Sense' dested the Premiere Dark Sense (the post does not call itself Episode I-only); 'Dengar With Blaster Carabine' dested Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'Boba Fett In Slave 1' dested Boba Fett In Slave I.",
  "Posted 'Secret Plans' is listed under Effects in the 60, so it is the Special Edition Effect, not a Defensive Shield."
